      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "literal",
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "癞子在檐坎前头那两步路上来回来去。走到头就掉头，一刻不停。那块地他今天翻了不晓得多少遍了，还在翻。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "癞子。",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "smirk"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "literal",
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "癞子没抬头。走到头，掉头，又走回来。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "喂——癞子！",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……啊？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "你又在刨啥子？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "smirk"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "找钱。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "这点找得到钱？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "前天在这点捡到一个。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "……一个。",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "laugh"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "收到起吧。今天老子接了个大活路。",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "laugh"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "哦。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……二哥，好多钱嘛？"
        }
      ],
      "text": "癞子在檐坎前头那两步路上来回来去。走到头就掉头，一刻不停。那块地他今天翻了不晓得多少遍了，还在翻。"
    },
    "branch_count": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "literal",
        "name": "旁白"
