      "next": "join_taboo",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "literal",
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "关二狗把那包钱抖出来，当着癞子的面数。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "一……二……三……看到没得？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "laugh"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……二哥。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "这个钱，边边上毛起的。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "啥子？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "毛起的。私铸的。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "literal",
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "癞子成天在地上摸铜板，啥子钱一上手他就晓得。这个他不会认错。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "……老子晓得。算了算了，算它一个。",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "关二狗把那包钱抖出来，当着癞子的面数。"
    },
    "branch_brag": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "player"
      },
      "next": "join_taboo",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "钱嘛，先不忙给你看。老子先问你——牛头梁梁，你晓得在哪点不？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "smirk"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "literal",
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "癞子走到头，掉头，走回来，才开口。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……晓得。从跑马梁上去。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "二哥，你问那个凼凼做啥子？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "有人喊老子去那点，背个人下来。",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "smirk"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……"
        }
      ],
      "text": "钱嘛，先不忙给你看。老子先问你——牛头梁梁，你晓得在哪点不？"
    },
