          "text": "……我不去。"
        }
      ],
      "text": "一个人背不动。你跟老子一路去，五五。"
    },
    "join_taboo": {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "npc"
      },
      "next": "hard_talk",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "牛头凼那个地方，我听人说过。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "听哪个说的？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……去年，茶馆门口有个人说的。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "哪个人嘛？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "smirk"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……我不认得。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "literal",
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "癞子走了个来回。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "他说，喊你莫回头、莫灭灯、有人喊你莫张视的那个人……"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……不是喊你去背人。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "……啥子意思？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "我不晓得。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "那个人后头就没得了。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "player"
          },
          "text": "没得了是啥子意思？",
          "portrait": {
            "emotion": "calm"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "kind": "npc"
          },
          "text": "……就是没得了噻。"
        }
      ],
      "text": "牛头凼那个地方，我听人说过。"
    },
